     "next": "[CR]",
     "note": "p.26, p.29-30: SDI carries C[31:0] in each software-mode access; C16 (C23:0_EN) = 1 updates the whole register at the 32nd SCLK falling edge; C17 READ_EN outputs CR on SDO_x with the next access"
